msgid ""
"*This page is for users who wish to install contributed packages. If you "
"want to contribute a package, please see* :doc:`package contributions </"
"developer/general/package-contributions>` *.*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/installing-contributed-packages.rst:11
#: 02c9acfa265f424db031eb0901318eeb
msgid ""
"Contributed packages are software created by the community of Qubes OS "
"users. They are managed, reviewed, and signed by the Qubes OS maintainer "
"team to ensure they are safe to install on Qubes OS. Qubes OS contributed "
"packages are available under the `QubesOS-contrib <https://github.com/"
"QubesOS-contrib/>`__ GitHub Project. This is a place where our community "
"can :doc:`contribute Qubes OS related packages, additions and various "
"customizations </developer/general/package-contributions>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/installing-contributed-packages.rst:14
#: dd1944bc089c4b4da11342c769eeeca5
msgid "Installing the repositories"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/installing-contributed-packages.rst:17
#: 84678554f39748c3aeb79227f81e4242
msgid ""
"If you want to install one of these packages, first you need to enable the "
"repository in your system (dom0 and/or templates). This can be done by "
"installing the ``qubes-repo-contrib`` package. This package includes the "
"repository definition and keys necessary to download, verify, and install "
"`QubesOS-contrib <https://github.com/QubesOS-contrib/>`__ packages."
msgstr ""

